        "name": "The One Line Poster Rule",
        "body": "Poster type never wraps: it shrinks to fit its box (`useFitText`, `usePosterLines`). A poster headline that breaks across lines is a bug, unless it is deliberately set as separate fitted lines.",
        "section": "typography"
